     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi everyone<div><br></div><div>could any one tell me what is wrong in my syntax of Mplus?</div><div><br></div><div><div>*** ERROR in MODEL command</div><div>  Unknown variable(s) in an ON statement:  NR</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Hear is my full syntax</div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\"> TITLE: Latent Regression Model for not-reached items</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         that ignores omitted items;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  DATA:  FILE IS missing.dat;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  VARIABLE:</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">    NAMES ARE i1-i22 do1-do22 nr;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">    USEVARIABLES ARE i1-i22 do1-do22;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">    CATEGORICAL ARE i1-i22 do1-do22;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">    MISSING ARE all (-99);</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  ANALYSIS: ESTIMATOR IS MLR;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  MODEL: xi BY i1-i22*(d1-d22);</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         [i1$1-i22$1](thr1-thr22);</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         ! Identification with Var(xi) = 1 and E(theta) = 0</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         ! using the MODEL CONSTRAINT command</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         nr   (vnu);</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         xi   (vxi);</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         [nr] (mnu);</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         [xi] (mxi);</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         ! Latent Regression Model with the number of not-reached items (nr)</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         ! as independent variable</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">         xi ON nr (regxi);</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  MODEL CONSTRAINT:</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  ! Only for model identification</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  0 = mxi + regxi*mnu;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  0 = regxi**2 * vnu + vxi -1;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  ! Computing the item difficulties from thresholds</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  new(b1-b22);</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  b1=thr1/d1;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  b2=thr2/d2;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  b3=thr3/d3;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  b4=thr4/d4;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  b5=thr5/d5;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  b6=thr6/d6;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  b7=thr7/d7;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  b8=thr8/d8;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  b9=thr9/d9;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font