ILE IS EAP_NotReachedOnlyModel.dat;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">            SAVE IS FSCORES;</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">*** ERROR in MODEL command</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">  Unknown variable(s) in an ON statement:  NR</font></div></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
