f\">  ! Only for model identification</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  0 = mxi + regxi*mnu;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  0 = regxi**2 * vnu + vxi -1;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  ! Computing the item difficulties from thresholds</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  new(b1-b22);</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b1=thr1/d1;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b2=thr2/d2;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b3=thr3/d3;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b4=thr4/d4;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b5=thr5/d5;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b6=thr6/d6;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b7=thr7/d7;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b8=thr8/d8;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b9=thr9/d9;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b10=thr10/d10;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#0000ff\">  b11=thr11/d11;</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-si